        "name": "white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/22/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "もりの　なかの　みずべで　くらす。\nひるまは　もりの　そとに　でて\nこうらの　きに　ひかりを　あてる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "숲 속의 물가에서 산다.\n낮에는 숲 밖으로 나와서\n등껍질의 나무에 빛을 쬔다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il vit en forêt près de l’eau. En journée, il la quitte\npour dorer sa carapace feuillue au soleil.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es lebt in der Nähe von Wasser in Wäldern.\nTagsüber verlässt es diese, um ein Sonnenbad\nzu nehmen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive en los bosques cerca del agua. Por el día, sale a\nque les dé el sol a las plantas de su espalda.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive nelle foreste vicino all’acqua, ma esce di giorno\nper far prendere sole alle piante sul guscio.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It lives along water in forests. In the daytime,\nit leaves the forest to sunbathe its treed shell.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "森の　中の　水辺で　暮らす。\n昼間は　森の　外に　出て\n甲羅の　木に　光を　当てる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive en los bosques cerca del agua. Por el día, sale a\nque les dé el sol a las plantas de su espalda.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "きれいな　みずが　わきでる　ばしょを\nしっていて　なかまの　ポケモンを\nせなかに　のせて　そこまで　はこぶ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "깨끗한 물이 솟아나는 장소를\n알고 있어서 동료 포켓몬을\n등에 태우고 그곳까지 데려다 준다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il sait d’instinct où trouver une source d’eau pure.\nIl y transporte d’autres Pokémon sur son dos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es weiß, wo es reinstes Quellwasser finden kann.\nTrägt andere Pokémon auf seinem Rücken dorthin.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sabe dónde encontrar manantiales de agua pura y\nlleva a los Pokémon amigos hasta allí en su lomo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
